### Object Example

```java id="x91mcz"
class Person {
    String name;

    Person(String name) {
        this.name = name;
    }
}

Person p1 = new Person("Prem");
Person p2 = new Person("Prem");

System.out.println(p1 == p2);        // false
System.out.println(p1.equals(p2));   // false (not overridden)
```

